     2000             (adybug/src/main.s):00205         FB_VIRT    equ  $2000           ; virtual base of framebuffer (PAR1)
     9800             (adybug/src/main.s):00206         FB_END     equ  $9800           ; one past last FB byte (192 rows × 160 B)
     0030             (adybug/src/main.s):00207         FB_PHYS    equ  $30             ; physical page 0 of FB
